68K GAS  /home/claude/app/contenido/consolas_demos/megadrive/demo.s 			page 1


   1               	| «Paso a paso» demo for the Sega Mega Drive (68000 + VDP 315-5313 in mode 5, H40, PAL).
   2               	| Plane B: sky and ground. Plane A: clouds that drift one pixel per frame (horizontal scroll table)
   3               	| One 16x16 sprite that moves one pixel per frame; its attribute entry lives in 68000 RAM and is co
   4               	| a VDP DMA in every vertical blank. The Z80 gets a two-byte program (DI, HALT) and stays idle.
   5               	| Assembled with GNU as for the 68000 (binutils-m68k-linux-gnu); see build.sh. Licence: CC0 1.0.
   6               	| Each «[tag]» names the Spanish explanation in explicaciones.es.txt.
